                                              skos:altLabel "hasSuccessor"@en ,
                                                            "isAntecedentOf"@en ,
                                                            "predecessorOf"@en ;
                                              skos:example "My life between 18-24 years has successor my life between 32-40 years, since there is an intermediary (i.e. my life between 25-32 years)."@en ;
                                              skos:prefLabel "foreruns"@en ;
                                              ns1:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 "A causal relation between the y effected and the x causing entities with intermediaries, where x isCauseOf y and not(y isCauseOf x)."@en ;
                                              ns1:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f "Transitivity is implemented at A-Box level with a SWRL rule."@en .

