        ns1:EMMO_70fe84ff_99b6_4206_a9fc_9a8931836d84 "One bel is defined as `1⁄2 ln(10) neper`."@en ;
        ns1:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 """A logarithmic unit of sound pressure equal to 10 decibels (dB),  It is defined as: 1 B = (1/2) log₁₀(Np)

