                                              ns1:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f "In Peirce semiotics this kind of sign category is called symbol. However, since symbol is also used in formal languages, the name is changed in conventional."@en .


###  https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_35d4c439_fcb6_4399_a855_a89a207b41e9
