                                              ns1:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 """An objective comparative measure of hot or cold.

Temperature is a relative quantity that can be used to express temperature differences. Unlike ThermodynamicTemperature, it cannot express absolute temperatures."""@en ;
                                              ns1:EMMO_fe015383_afb3_44a6_ae86_043628697aa2 "https://doi.org/10.1351/goldbook.T06261" .


